ase randomly output one of \"[[A]]\", \"[[B]]\", \"[[C]]\", or \"[[D]]\";\n(3) Please only output the most likely answer index based on the given information, and do not output any other content.\n\n[Story]\nZhao Lei attends a costume party with the theme \"Alien Party\". He dresses up as a green alien and confidently walks into the party scene.\n\n[Question]\nZhao Lei should feel excited to enter the party, but why does he feel embarrassed instead?\n\n[Candidate Answers]\nA. Zhao Lei finds that his good friend does not wear an alien costume, which makes him feel embarrassed.\nB. Zhao Lei's alien costume is somewhat similar to one person's costume at the party.\nC. Zhao Lei is the only one in the whole field wearing an alien costume, others do not wear it.\nD. Zhao Lei's alien costume is not attractive at all at the party, making him feel like he has no face.","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.001032206056019464,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af3e2f5d6006945d2803f8c","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794368245664,"createTime":"2026-11-11 11:37:25","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"184c72ed2268460baf4311e142259bb8"}